---

This repository analyses and documents "Weather for Android" by Kian Konrad
(https://github.com/Kian-hdr/Weather), which is MIT licensed and remains the
copyright of its author. No application binaries, and no redistributable copy
of that application, are included here; the material is analysis, method and
the porting scripts written for this work.

Evidence files under 03_rea/evidence/ are verbatim outputs of tooling run
against that APK (rea-agents, jadx, apktool) and describe its contents; they
are included for reproducibility of the analysis.
